# Krenko, Baron of Tin Street: "Whenever an artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may pay {R}. If you do, create a
# 1/1 red Goblin creature token. It gains haste until end of turn." On turn 1, the turn Krenko is cast (its own haste lets it
# tap), Bot1 sacrifices a Mox Emerald to Krenko's own ability, pays {R} with the Mountain, and the new Goblin attacks the turn it
# is made (it has haste), a 2/2 once Krenko's ability, which was below the trigger, puts a counter on it too: Bot2 takes 2.
# The Goblin is no artifact, so nothing is asked a second time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Krenko, Baron of Tin Street
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Krenko, Baron of Tin Street.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Krenko, Baron of Tin Street.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Mox Emerald)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.PayCost
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Token.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Token.Keywords = Haste
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Goblin Token > Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Mox Emerald
Bot2.Life = 18
